{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Metz this afternoon, the light already softening on the Moselle. I walked the ramparts to catch the valley below, a stillness that suits the end of a day’s labor. The cathedral looms from outside, imposing but distant; I have no time to enter its mysteries tonight, only to observe its stone.\n\nDinner was decent, though I found the company at the theatre rather tedious. It was crowded with garrison officers, their laughter loud and their attention short. They watched a vaudeville with a distraction that reminded me of students who have not yet learned the discipline of the mind. One learns little from such spectacle, but I confess the wine was better than the play.\n\nI have secured a seat in the front coupé for our departure to Paris tomorrow. The journey will be long, and the heat oppressive, but I look forward to the movement. Do not worry for me; I am well enough to endure the dust and the noise.\n\nYour affectionate,\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795080495,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":218,"prompt_tokens":945,"total_tokens":1163,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-WkBwbxDzzQaHhT4oSk76Ck33vBSdJujl","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":945,"prompt_ms":938.43,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.993047619047619,"prompt_per_second":1007.0010549534862,"predicted_n":218,"predicted_ms":5151.208,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.738285714285713,"predicted_per_second":42.126041115016136}}